# Group4A - Approach

## 📝 About The Project
This is a Note-Taking API project developed by Group 4A. 
It allows users to register, login, create, edit and delete notes securely.

## 🚀 Tech Stack
- Backend: Node.js, Express.js
- Database: MongoDB
- Authentication: JWT
- Tools: Git, GitHub

## 🔧 Installation & Setup

1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/Apostle-droid/Group4A-Approach-.git

2. Install dependencies
npm install

3. Run the project
npm run dev

## 📚 API Documentation

### Authentication
- POST /api/register - Register a new user
- POST /api/login - Login existing user

### Notes
- GET /api/notes - Fetch all notes
- GET /api/notes/:id - Fetch single note
- POST /api/notes - Create new note
- PUT /api/notes/:id - Update note
- DELETE /api/notes/:id - Delete note

## 📂 Project Structure
- /backend - Backend API
- /frontend - Frontend files
- README.md - Project documentation

